# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#1053, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in git,
#   but if you prefer to ignore it, uncomment the next line:
#Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similarly, usually poetry.lock is committed, but uncomment if needed:
#poetry.lock

